    "id": "pose_11_squat_hands_on_knees",
    "name": "Deep squat, hands on knees",
    "description": "Deep squat with both feet flat on the floor and the hips below knee height, knees pointing forward and slightly apart, trunk leaning forward a little. Both hands rest on top of the knees with the fingers hanging over the kneecaps; the head is raised to look forward. Left/right are the character's own.",
    "targetModels": [
      "female",
      "male"
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      "Reference: user-supplied image (ai-pose-gallery.pages.dev full_single_P061, viewed only; not stored in the repository).",
      "Front view only: the depth layout (hips about 0.18 hips-height behind the ankles, trunk flexed ~29 deg through spine_01-03, head extended back to face forward) is assumed for balance with flat feet.",
      "Feet flat: ankle dorsiflexion is capped at 25 deg by the rig limits, so the shins lean ~21 deg and the hips sit slightly behind rather than straight above the heels; buttocks stay off the floor.",
      "Knees forward and slightly apart (thighs abducted ~10 deg, externally rotated ~12 deg); feet toed out 6 deg.",
      "Hands placed palm-down on the knees with the fingers draped forward over the kneecaps; thumbs extended (thumb_01 x = -20) so the male thumb tip does not sink into the inner knee.",
      "Authored on rig/female.glb; the male uses the same rotations and the hips-height-relative root offset."
    ],
    "generator": "scripts/pose_author/poses/pose_11_squat_hands_on_knees.py"
